[00:19.82]1. How does it make you feel
[00:23.66]when you preach and teach with zeal,
[00:28.34]When you know you’ve done your part
[00:31.18]to reach an honest heart?
[00:38.76]Knowing you’ve done your best;
[00:42.34]then our God will do the rest.
[00:46.96]Honest hearts he surely knows—
[00:50.06]all those to him disposed.
[00:55.63](Chorus)
[00:55.95]It makes us glad, and we rejoice
[01:00.27]to give our heart and mind and voice.
[01:05.35]So may our sacrifice of praise
[01:08.51]continue all our days.
[01:20.41]2. How does it make you feel
[01:24.27]when the words you speak appeal
[01:28.57]To the ones whose heart is right
[01:31.95]for everlasting life?
[01:39.07]Some people turn away,
[01:43.05]others might be led astray.
[01:47.19]Still we’re glad to bear his name
[01:50.55]and witness just the same.
[01:56.27](Chorus)
[01:56.57]It makes us glad, and we rejoice
[02:00.77]to give our heart and mind and voice.
[02:05.87]So may our sacrifice of praise
[02:09.11]continue all our days.
[02:14.35]3. How does it make you feel,
[03:05.87]knowing God’s support is real,
[03:10.23]And that he’s entrusted you
[03:13.41]to do the work we do?
[03:20.51]Proudly we preach and teach,
[03:23.59]using bold but gracious speech,
[03:28.97]Searching out deserving ones;
[03:31.87]this work will soon be done.
[03:37.53](Chorus)
[03:37.95]It makes us glad, and we rejoice
[03:42.13]to give our heart and mind and voice.
[03:47.31]So may our sacrifice of praise
[03:50.41]continue all our days.
